  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 211
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Where are the speakers? / Where does the",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 212
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "conversation probably take place?",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 213
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 214
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "地点题往往不直接说 restaurant / airport /",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 215
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "clinic，而是让你通过行为和物品推断。",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 216
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “别等地点名字，听他们正在做什么、接触什么东西。”",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 217
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 不同地点有稳定的“场景词”：菜单/账单→餐馆；登机口/护照→机场；处方/预",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 218
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "约→诊所。",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 219
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 220
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先看选项，想每个地点各自最典型的行为词。",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 221
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 听“服务对象 + 行为”：谁给谁提供什么服务？",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 222
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 优先使用两个以上线索，不用一个词就下结论。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 223
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 如果某个词在多个地点都可能出现，用后续动作确认。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 224
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 225
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 226
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 227
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· menu + order + bill → restaurant",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 228
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· boarding + gate + passport → airport",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 229
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· prescription + appointment + symptom → clinic/hospital",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 230
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· borrow + due date + library card → library",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 231
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 至少两个线索指向同一场景。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 232
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 三个选项都像时，抓“只有某个地点才自然发生”的动作，例如 check in a",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 233
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "suitcase。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 234
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 235
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Could I see the menu? I'd like the soup, please.",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 236
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "即使没有说 restaurant，menu + order food 已足够定位。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 237
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 238
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只根据背景噪音猜。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 239
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 听见一个泛词就过早锁定。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 240
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 241
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 行为和地点匹配吗？",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 242
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有没有更具体的后续线索推翻第一次判断？",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 243
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 244
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 245
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 246
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 地点看动作，不等地点名。",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 247
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 249
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “boarding pass, gate, luggage”最可能哪里？",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 250
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. “menu, bill, table for two”最可能哪里？",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 251
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. “prescription, appointment, headache”最可能哪里？",
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "sourceIndex": 252
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. “due date, borrow, return”最可能哪里？",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 253
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 地点题只有一个泛词“book”，能否立刻选library？",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 254
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. airport；2. restaurant；3. clinic/hospital；4. library；5. 不能，要等更专属行为线索。",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 255
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L2 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L2”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "sourceIndex": 256
    }
